        "subject": "Your inbox is clean",
        "htmlContent": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1c130d;max-width:520px\"><p>Hi {{ $(\"Job\").first().json.name || \"there\" }},</p><p><b>Your inbox is clean.</b> I sorted <b>{{ $json.processed }}</b> emails: {{ $json.trashed }} trashed and {{ $json.archived }} kept and archived.</p><p>My access to your Gmail is now closed. You can check it any time at <a href=\"https://myaccount.google.com/permissions\" style=\"color:#b8642a\">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>.</p><p>If this saved you some stress today, I would love to hear about it. It takes less than 2 minutes:</p><p style=\"margin:24px 0\"><a href=\"https://testimonial.to/smartinboxcleanup\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#e6935a;color:#1c130d;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none\">Leave a quick review</a></p><p>For any issue, reach me at <a href=\"mailto:support@buildwithjuliet.com\" style=\"color:#b8642a\">support@buildwithjuliet.com</a></p><p>Thanks,<br>Juliet, SmartInboxCleanup<br><a href=\"https://smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com\" style=\"color:#b8642a\">smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com</a></p><p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\"><a href=\"https://smartinboxcleanup.buildwithjuliet.com\"><img src=\"https://hq.buildwithjuliet.com/logo.png\" alt=\"buildwithjuliet\" height=\"48\" style=\"height:48px;width:auto;border:0;display:block\"></a></p></div>",
        "sender": "kosy@buildwithjuliet.com",
        "receipients": "={{ $(\"Job\").first().json.contact_email || $(\"Job\").first().json.gmail }}",
        "additionalFields": {},
